{
  "abstract": "\"YANG Library\" (RFC 8525) specifies the \"ietf-yang-library\" YANG module that provides information about the YANG modules, datastores, and datastore schemas used by a network management server. This document augments the \"ietf-yang-library\" module to provide the augmented-by list. It facilitates the process of obtaining all dependencies between YANG modules by querying the network management server's YANG library. This document updates RFC 8525 to also include the augmented-by list.",
